### Working tooling and notes, not yet committed (may be added deliberately later) ###
# `git add tools/...` / `git add docs/...` kept sweeping these in by accident. Ignoring them makes
# an accidental add fail instead of silently staging. Already-tracked files (tools/eqp-merge/
# add_bomber_size.py) are unaffected; to add something here on purpose, use `git add -f <path>`.
tools/
docs/
# Coding-agent briefing. Local working notes, untracked 2026-09-06 -- it is a scratchpad for the
# assistant's own context, not project documentation, and the file stays on disk.
AGENTS.md

# Build/verification tooling. The ad-hoc probes and the vendored scripts/verify/node_modules are
# local scratch and stay untracked, but everything build.gradle.kts actually invokes is listed back
# in below -- otherwise `check`, verifyProductionSmokeTest and verifyMobileSmokeTest pass here (the
# files are on disk) and fail on a fresh clone. If you wire a new script into a Gradle task, add it
# to this list in the same commit. node_modules is rebuilt by verifyProductionSmokeTestNpmInstall.
scripts/*
!scripts/check_author_credits.py
!scripts/check_campaign_dialogue.py
!scripts/check_keyboard_manual.py
!scripts/check_kotlin_js_consistency.py
!scripts/check_objective_visibility.py
!scripts/check_ruleset_keys.py
!scripts/check_scenario_events.py
!scripts/check_tracked_sources.py
!scripts/check_translations.py
!scripts/check_unit_descriptions.py
# imported by check_translations.py
!scripts/extract_story_dialogue_i18n.py
!scripts/verify/
scripts/verify/*
!scripts/verify/combatlog-button-probe.mjs
!scripts/verify/hero-roster-probe.mjs
!scripts/verify/mobile-smoke.mjs
!scripts/verify/og-fidelity-regression-probe.mjs
!scripts/verify/verify.mjs
!scripts/verify/package.json
!scripts/verify/package-lock.json
